    description: "Found by the 2026-10-25 docstring staleness audit (dev 95c0ff7b93): a reviewer flagged it and a default-REJECT verifier confirmed it by reading the code itself (a repro where stated). Severity is not asserted; impact not measured on the corpus.\n\n- d_lang.py: hypergumbo-lang-extended1 does not declare `tree-sitter-language-pack` -- evidence: packages/hypergumbo-lang-extended1/pyproject.toml `dependencies` lists hypergumbo-core plus zig/odin/agda/solidity/verilog/vhdl/llvm/tlaplus only; hypergumbo-core's dependencies do not include it either; it is declared only in hypergumbo-lang-mainstream/pyproject.toml:62 and hypergumbo-lang-common/pyproject.toml:25. About 30 extended1 analyzers set `language_pack_name` (asm.py:148, d_lang.py:814, bitbake.py:105, fish.py:171, hack.py:482, haxe.py:190, jsonnet.py:370, ...).\n\nOnly installed transitively through lang-common or lang-mainstream.\n\nNot asserted: that the fix is the one sketched above, or that no other language has the same shape."  # a23f
